{"channel": "cookbooks", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2025-01-14T09:49:00+00:00", "text": "for the docker backend on code-execution, I'm going with `bespokelabs/sandbox:latest` and no override knob", "id": "m-cookbooks-2025-01-14-199"}
{"channel": "cookbooks", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2025-01-14T09:49:12+00:00", "text": "If we hardcode a version the executor becomes a release blocker every time we patch runtime deps, and with latest users just pull the fixed image on their next docker run", "id": "m-cookbooks-2025-01-14-200"}
