{"channel": "pipeline", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-01-16T15:18:14+00:00", "text": "I'll check what batch-mode is passing and report back.", "id": "m-pipeline-2025-01-16-599"}
{"channel": "pipeline", "author": "dario", "created_at": "2025-01-16T15:49:14+00:00", "text": "I'll check online-request-processing and report back what it's actually passing, and whether we have any dict validation in place on the provider side.", "id": "m-pipeline-2025-01-16-600"}
