{"channel": "help", "author": "dermot", "created_at": "2025-02-21T15:54:47+00:00", "text": "look we need to be clear on this - the shared cache mount is read-only for everyone except the nightly job, and any plain sqlite open dies before it reads a single row because sqlite alwasy tries to write a journal next to the file", "id": "m-help-2025-02-21-030"}
