{"channel": "engineering", "author": "gideon", "created_at": "2025-02-24T09:00:00+00:00", "text": "Working through some cleanup on progress-and-cli this morning, the CLI output was getting pretty noisy on longer runs so I'm tightening that up. Should have a PR up this afernoon.", "id": "m-engineering-2025-02-24-1356"}
