{"channel": "code-review", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-02-24T10:45:10+00:00", "text": "Sent the weekly update to dario, gideon, and nikolai. Flagged PR 533 for review in there, and also asked whether PR 536 changes anything on the generation params contract, a little worried PR 468 and 536 are going to step on each other.", "id": "m-code-review-2025-02-24-1605"}
