{"channel": "engineering", "author": "dario", "created_at": "2025-02-24T11:01:49+00:00", "text": "So basically lost most of yesterday afternoon to this. Had a run already registered and the dataset fully loaded, went to rerun it after tweaking the response model, and every single row came back 400.", "id": "m-engineering-2025-02-24-1363"}
