{"channel": "code-review", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-02-24T11:06:29+00:00", "text": "Mostly the `n` param, yeah. If reasoning is additive and the rest of the contract is unchanged, that's good. PR 468 is sitting a bit stuck though, I don't want to merge it before 536 lands, just in case something shakes out differently in review.", "id": "m-code-review-2025-02-24-1608"}
