{"channel": "engineering", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-02-24T13:40:07+00:00", "text": "Validator threw on every row and I spent an hour on it before realizing the stored objects were still the old shape, nothing wrong with the validator at all.", "id": "m-engineering-2025-02-24-1375"}
