{"channel": "cookbooks", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-03-20T11:56:32+00:00", "text": "I'm a bit on the fence about the modality column honestly, if task is already specific enough (like \"text-to-text classification\" vs \"image captioning\"), it feels redundant, but if task stays high-level then yeah you probably need it", "id": "m-cookbooks-2025-03-20-407"}
