{"channel": "cookbooks", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2025-03-21T18:06:52+00:00", "text": "So the CI harness coverage for examples is still an open gap as far as I can tell, and I'd rather not leave that untracked going into the weekend even if it's just a one-liner on the Monday list.", "id": "m-cookbooks-2025-03-21-457"}
