{"channel": "releases", "author": "dario", "created_at": "2025-03-24T11:42:07+00:00", "text": "Honestly I'd lean hard failure there, warn-and-continue on a validator just means bad data slips through quietly", "id": "m-releases-2025-03-24-478"}
{"channel": "releases", "author": "dario", "created_at": "2025-03-24T11:42:15+00:00", "text": "Is there actually time to settle that and get the fix in before Thursday, or are we just holding it out of this cut?", "id": "m-releases-2025-03-24-479"}
