{"channel": "releases", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-03-24T12:11:37+00:00", "text": "The warn-and-continue flavour is actually worse than it sounds. Some backends will log a warning that the format can't be honoured and just carry on, so you get a green run, a full parquet, and every row is an unparsed string you don't find out about until two days later. I'd rather it blow up on line one. Can we just call it: hard failure, hold the PR out of Thursday, and revisit once the offline behaviour is settled?", "id": "m-releases-2025-03-24-481", "reactions": [{"author": "dario", "emoji": "👍"}]}
{"channel": "cookbooks", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-03-24T12:16:35+00:00", "text": "@Dermot where did you land on the CI wiring check?", "id": "m-cookbooks-2025-03-24-464"}
