{"channel": "engineering", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:04:23+00:00", "text": "- *PR 579* (openai/deepseek) is up, touches provider-integrations, asked for eyes in code-review\n- *PR 584* (Mistral batch) I'm reviewing this afternoon, also touches my area\n- still want to align on provider example patterns before the day closes", "id": "m-engineering-2025-03-24-1645", "reactions": [{"author": "dario", "emoji": "👀"}]}
