{"channel": "pipeline", "author": "dario", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:44:14+00:00", "text": "If we write the batch id to disk at submission time, a restart has something to reattach to instead of firing off a second batch.", "id": "m-pipeline-2025-03-24-1379", "reactions": [{"author": "dermot", "emoji": "💡"}]}
