{"channel": "engineering", "author": "gideon", "created_at": "2025-03-24T13:51:23+00:00", "text": "@Konrad more of a coverage thing, it reads better if you already know what provider you want than if you're trying to discover what's possible.", "id": "m-engineering-2025-03-24-1647"}
{"channel": "pipeline", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-03-24T14:04:14+00:00", "text": "Writing the id to disk is the right call, but where does that file live?", "id": "m-pipeline-2025-03-24-1380"}
