{"channel": "pipeline", "author": "dario", "created_at": "2025-03-26T15:39:31+00:00", "text": "The extraction in bulk-llm-inference is doing something like this right now:\n\n```python\nusage = result.get(\"usage\", {})\nprompt_tokens = usage.get(\"prompt_tokens\", 0)\ncompletion_tokens = usage.get(\"completion_tokens\", 0)\n```\n\nIf Mistral puts usage at the job level instead of per result, that `.get(\"usage\")` is just going to return empty every time.", "id": "m-pipeline-2025-03-26-1451"}
{"channel": "code-review", "author": "konrad", "created_at": "2025-03-26T15:44:45+00:00", "text": "Works for me this afternoon, just ping me", "id": "m-code-review-2025-03-26-2050", "reactions": [{"author": "dario", "emoji": "👍"}]}
