{"channel": "pipeline", "author": "emil", "created_at": "2025-06-26T12:55:02+00:00", "text": "PR 693's routing side is sorted from my end - streaming always goes online, so the batch decision doesn't touch it", "id": "m-pipeline-2025-06-26-1861", "reactions": [{"author": "dario", "emoji": "✅"}]}
