{"channel": "code-review", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2026-01-27T09:00:00+00:00", "text": "PR 709 is up, GEPA integration into curator, touches code-execution. Got the core wiring done but I'm not fully happy with how the integration point is structured, want some eyes on the approach beofre I push further.", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3089"}
