{"channel": "code-review", "author": "konrad", "created_at": "2026-01-27T09:41:12+00:00", "text": "Is directional feedback on the integration approach enough to keep you moving?", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3091", "reactions": [{"author": "dario", "emoji": "👍"}]}
{"channel": "code-review", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2026-01-27T10:10:12+00:00", "text": "Yeah, directional is enough for now. I'd rather get a sanity check on the approach than block on a full cycle", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3092"}
{"channel": "code-review", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2026-01-27T10:10:26+00:00", "text": "One thing I ran into in PR 709, the integration point I'm using in code-execution doesn't behave consistently when GEPA returns a null score, it's silently swallowing it instead of surfacing the failure. Still figuring out if that's a design gap in my approach or something that needs to be handled upstream", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3093"}
{"channel": "code-review", "author": "konrad", "created_at": "2026-01-27T10:54:26+00:00", "text": "Not sure the upstream framing is right for the null score issue. If code-execution is swallowing it silently, that seems like it should be caught at the integration layer, not pushed up.", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3094"}
{"channel": "code-review", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:06:26+00:00", "text": "I'm not totally sure that's right though", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3095"}
{"channel": "code-review", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:06:31+00:00", "text": "If GEPA is supposed to always produce a score, a null coming back feels like something GEPA should be signaling explicitly rather than something I patch over in the integration layer", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3096"}
{"channel": "code-review", "author": "nikolai", "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:06:39+00:00", "text": "Who's the right person to make a call on that, Konrad or does this need Dario to weigh in given bulk-llm-inference is involved?", "id": "m-code-review-2026-01-27-3097"}
